From 150d11dc8de7e018797c2a9be82c7c2f368132a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 22:59:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 34/43] Later moves, batch 2: 37 moves with new effects

Set-up moves (Quiver Dance, Shell Smash, Coil...), self stat changes after
hits (Close Combat, Flame Charge...), Head Smash/Flare Blitz recoil, the
elemental fangs, variable-power moves (Hex, Gyro Ball, Heavy Slam...),
Psyshock/Foul Play/Body Press stat swaps, Freeze-Dry, always-crit moves,
Hurricane and Sucker Punch. Three new battle effects plus move-specific
hooks; learnsets and tutor data regenerated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
