 - `peak_trainers.py`: peak teams, gym rematches and the Elite Four round 3.
-- `moves.py <showdown>/data <batch>`: later moves, the modern tutor and its data.
+- `moves.py <showdown>/data <batch>`: later moves, the modern tutor and its data;
+  `moves_engine_b2.py` adds the battle effects batch 2 needs.
 
